      "text": "FORMAL PRIORITIES:\n  - Flat color areas (like Gauguin's cloisonné)\n  - Line and color operating INDEPENDENTLY\n    (line doesn't bound color; color doesn't follow line)\n  - Decoration as a serious aesthetic value\n    (Matisse: \"an art of balance, purity... like a good\n    armchair in which to rest\")\n```"
