      "text": "WOODCUT AS PREFERRED PRINT MEDIUM:\n  Die Brücke artists revived the woodcut -- the cut marks\n  show, the grain shows, the directness of hand to material\n  is visible. Antithesis of academic engraving's precision.\n  Connects to German Gothic woodcut tradition (= historical\n  nationalism as aesthetic strategy).\n```"
