      "text": "FORMAL SOLUTION:\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Show multiple simultaneous viewpoints in one image:      │\n  │   - The face shown from front AND profile simultaneously │\n  │   - The guitar shown from above AND from the side        │\n  │   - The surface of a table tilted to show the top        │\n  │   - The drawer open to show its contents                 │\n  │   - Multiple light sources from different angles         │\n  │                                                          │\n  │ MONOCHROME (near-black, grey, ochre):                    │\n  │   Color is eliminated to prevent the eye from            │\n  │   \"reading\" color as surface or object.                  │\n  │   Only form and structure remain.                        │\n  │                                                          │\n  │ SHALLOW SPACE:                                           │\n  │   The multiple planes stack in a shallow zone,           │\n  │   not in deep illusionistic space.                       │\n  │   The picture surface is acknowledged, not hidden.       │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    }
